# Package Index

## `@sonaraem/ai-provider`
Swappable LLM client — `getAIModel(task)` / `getModelId(task)` resolve a model per that task's fixed assigned provider (`TASK_PROVIDER` in `models.ts`, each task pinned to one of `groq` | `concentrate` — not a global switch); `isProviderConfigured(task)` gates on that provider's credential; `withLLMRetry()` shares the 429-aware backoff/hard-4xx-abort logic across call sites. This package is the one place allowed to call `createGroq`/`createOpenAI` — every other consumer goes through `getAIModel()` instead. See `.cursor/rules/packages/trigger.mdc` § LLM Keys in Tasks.

## `@sonaraem/auth`
Dual Better Auth instances: `createDashboardAuth()` (Spotify OAuth, `/api/auth`) and `createAdminAuth()` (email/password, `/api/admin-auth`). Import from `@sonaraem/core` as `dashboardAuth`, `adminAuth`, or `auth` (dashboard alias).

## `@sonaraem/common`
Shared schemas, types, services, Trigger.dev task definitions. The bulk of business logic.
- `src/schemas/` — Zod input/output schemas per domain (including `admin/`, `waitlist/`)
- `src/utils/waitlist-token.ts` — HMAC tokens for waitlist status URLs
- `src/utils/waitlist-gate.ts` — pure proxy gate decision logic
- `src/services/brain/` — LLM classification, embeddings, clustering, playlist generation
- `src/services/music/` — Spotify sync, lyrics fetching
- `src/services/organize/` — pipeline orchestration + DB helpers (`updateRun`, `updateStageProgress`, `checkCancelled`)
- `src/trigger/tasks/` — Trigger.dev task definitions (parent + stage tasks + email tasks)

Run tests: `pnpm --filter @sonaraem/common test`

## `@sonaraem/config`
Shared `tsconfig.base.json`. No runtime code.

## `@sonaraem/core`
Lazy initialization of DB + `dashboardAuth` / `adminAuth`. Re-exports `auth` as dashboard alias.

## `@sonaraem/db`
Drizzle ORM schema, migrations, and DB client. Auto-detects driver: `.neon.tech` URL → serverless, otherwise → `pg`.

## `@sonaraem/env`
Zod-validated environment variable presets. **Always import from here, never `process.env`.**
- `@sonaraem/env/server` — server-side (API, services, tasks)
- `@sonaraem/env/presets/api` — API app preset
- `@sonaraem/env/presets/web` — web app preset
- `@sonaraem/env/presets/dashboard` — dashboard app preset
- `@sonaraem/env/presets/admin` — admin app preset

## `@sonaraem/logger`
Pino structured logger. `import { logger } from "@sonaraem/logger"`.

## `@sonaraem/orpc`
oRPC routers, procedures, context, and client. All API definitions live here.

## `@sonaraem/tracing`
OpenTelemetry instrumentation. Initialised at app startup.

## `@sonaraem/ui`
shadcn/ui component library + Tailwind config. Import components via `@sonaraem/ui` or `@/components/ui/*` within apps. Email templates do **not** use this package — see `@sonaraem/email`.

## `@sonaraem/email`
React Email templates (`emails/`), shared components (`components/`), Resend send helpers (`@sonaraem/email/send`). Preview via `pnpm dev:email`. See `.cursor/rules/packages/email.mdc`.

## Dependency Rules

- Apps can import from any package
- Packages can only import from packages with no circular deps
- `@sonaraem/common` must not import from `@sonaraem/orpc` or `@sonaraem/tracing`
